<title>GERMANY: Preussag takes over French Chaffoteaux.</title>
<headline>Preussag takes over French Chaffoteaux.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German steel and engineering group Preussag AG said on Monday that it had signed a deal to buy Chaffoteaux et Maury S.A., one of France's largest makers of gas and electric boilers.</p>
</text>
